/CreationDate (D:20140702115553-05'00')
/ModDate (D:20140702115553-05'00')
/Author (Platou, Anders S.)
/Keywords (*FORCE\(MECHANICS\);*MAGNUS EFFECT;*SPIN STABILIZED AMMUNITION;DETERMINATION;FIN STABILIZED AMMUNITION;MODEL TESTS;MOMENTS;SPINNING\(MOTION\);WIND TUNNEL MODELS)
/Subject (The effect of spin on the aerodynamic forces gen erated on a slowly spinning finned projectile is analyzed. Experiments in the BRL wind tunnels, which substantiate the analysis, are described and presented. It is seen that the Magnus forces and moments are as large as those existing on a rapidly spinning nonfinned projectile where these forces are known to have an influence on accuracy and stability.)
/Title (THE MAGNUS FORCE ON A FINNED BODY)
/Filename (/pdf/TR/AD0403767.pdf)
>>
